OL,3,AUS death row inmate Christa Pike
OL,4,Aconscious after failed execution,
OL,5,Alawyers say
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS death row inmate Christa Pike is
OL,8,F"conscious and speaking" after her
OL,9,Ffailed execution attempt, her lawyers
OL,10,Fsay.
OL,12,FPike, 50, continues to receive critical
OL,13,Fmedical care while handcuffed in
OL,14,Fhospital, according to a statement from
OL,15,Fher attorneys on Tuesday.
OL,17,FShe was sentenced to death following
OL,18,Fher conviction for murdering Colleen
OL,19,FSlemmer in 1995. But Pike survived two
OL,20,Flethal injections last week and was
OL,21,Ftransferred to a hospital in Nashville,
OL,22,FTennessee, for treatment.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
