OL,3,AUS death row inmate Christa Pike
OL,4,Aconscious after failed execution,
OL,5,Alawyers say
OL,6,
OL,7,FHer lawyers had said in the days
OL,8,Fafterwards that she was unconscious
OL,9,Fwhile medical staff cleared her body of
OL,10,Fthe pentobarbitol injected during the
OL,11,Ffailed execution attempt.
